{
  "Locking the training modules": [
    "The 5-Day Case Flow's training modules are frozen. The files below are recorded by SHA-256 and",
    ".github/scripts/training-locked.cjs fails Checks on any change to one of them, on a pull request or a push to main.",
    "Locked: the lesson data, the content sources, the files built from them, and the curriculum documents.",
    "Not locked: the engine that runs the modules (js/cm-case-flow.js), so how the course runs can still be fixed.",
    "To change a locked file: set its \"locked\" to false in this file, in its own commit, with the reason in the",
    "commit message. Once the change is approved, run `node .github/scripts/training-locked.cjs --relock` to",
    "record the new hashes and set \"locked\" back to true.",
    "A red check here is not a thing to work around: it means an edit reached the frozen training modules."
  ],
